  <div class="container submission-page"><div class="submission-layout"><div class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">ENTERPRISE LICENSING NETWORK</span><h1>Contact ELN.</h1><p class="lede">Leave your comments and an email address for a reply.</p></div><div class="submission-panel"><SubmissionForm kind="enquiry" client:load/></div></div></div>
</Base>
